        <activityName xml:lang="en">CEM I cement, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: CEM I cement, at plant
The dataset describes the production of cement (CEM I, Portland cement) in Switzerland \nTechnology: Industry data. Data extrapolated for year 2017-2021. average swiss production\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Bindemittel\nUVEK 2022 source file:CEM Suisse / Frank Werner\n\n
UUID: f6e494ae-dcd3-326b-9701-da19b3e1620e
The dataset describes the production of cement (CEM I) in Switzerland and covers the representative production mix of CEM I 42.5 und CEM I 52.5 R as defined in EN 197-1.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data. Data extrapolated for year 2017-2021. average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of several Swiss plants, intended to be representative for the Swiss production volume 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f6e494ae-dcd3-326b-9701-da19b3e1620e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
